  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 300,
   "width": 219,
   "height": 165,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700217,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A message to four people has\nONE body and FOUR sets of\nper-recipient state - each of\nwhich can independently mark\nit read, move it, label it or\ndelete it.\n\nWhich also means marking an\nemail read is a tiny row\nupdate rather than touching a\n50 KB blob.",
   "originalText": "A message to four people has\nONE body and FOUR sets of\nper-recipient state - each of\nwhich can independently mark\nit read, move it, label it or\ndelete it.\n\nWhich also means marking an\nemail read is a tiny row\nupdate rather than touching a\n50 KB blob.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "casn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1330,
   "y": 250,
   "width": 227,
   "height": 150,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100032,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700224,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The dashed lines are pointers,\nnot copies. Attachment dedup\nextends further than 4x: the\nsame slide deck forwarded\naround a company is stored\nonce regardless of how many\nseparate emails carry it - and\na content hash is an obvious\nkey, because attachments are\nimmutable by nature.",
   "originalText": "The dashed lines are pointers,\nnot copies. Attachment dedup\nextends further than 4x: the\nsame slide deck forwarded\naround a company is stored\nonce regardless of how many\nseparate emails carry it - and\na content hash is an obvious\nkey, because attachments are\nimmutable by nature.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
