   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700756,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a folder view shows sender, subject, date and read\nstate - not bodies. Bodies are ~50 KB and headers a\nfew hundred bytes, so fetching 50 full messages to\nrender a list would be ~2.5 MB for a screen that\ndisplays a few kilobytes. Which is why headers and\nbodies live in different places.",
